      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ambra911  -  AI billing for US ambulance (EMS) companies.\nTwo products today. They solve two different halves of the same problem.",
