      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When an insurer rejects a claim, it writes the\nappeal and gets it overturned.\n\n\"Denials wins the money back.\"",
